  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 719.06 Reporting Content and Method When CMDP Is Available",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 719.06 Reporting Content and Method When CMDP Is Available. When the CMDP becomes available, then:\n\n(a) The department shall notify each O/O of the date the system will be available for use;\n\n(b) The information regarding samples analyzed to meet monitoring requirements shall be the information required by the CMDP; and\n\n(c) The information required by (b), above, shall be submitted to the department using the CMDP.\n\nSource. #12669, eff 1-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
}
